    "title": "主詞動詞一致與句子結構",
    "subtitle": "Subject-Verb Agreement & Main Verbs",
    "group": "句子骨架",
    "summary": "找真正主詞與限定動詞，拆開長修飾語，處理單複數及並列結構。",
    "minutes": 8,
    "html": "<div class=\"callout tip\"><b>850+ 讀法練習</b><p>練習將長句標成主詞、限定動詞、修飾語。這也能加快 Part 7 的閱讀，尤其是插入關係子句的長主詞。</p></div>\n<div class=\"ch-head\"><span class=\"ch-no\">02</span><div><h2>主詞動詞一致與句子結構</h2><p class=\"ch-sub\">Subject-Verb Agreement &amp; Main Verbs</p></div></div>\n  <div class=\"tags\"><span>文法類別：動詞／句子結構</span><span class=\"f\">練習重點：主詞動詞一致與句子結構</span><span class=\"d\">難度：★★★☆☆</span></div>\n\n  <h3>🧱 文法架構</h3>\n  <div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"lbl\">先找限定動詞；並列謂語可由 and／or／but 連接</span><span class=\"slot\">主詞</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot\">（修飾語：介系詞片語／關係子句／分詞）</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot hl\">主要動詞（要跟真正的主詞一致）</span></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"lbl\">若同一子句已有完整謂語，且空格不是並列謂語，再檢查非限定形式</span><span class=\"slot\">S + V ...</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"slot hl2\">to V／V-ing／p.p.</span></div>\n\n  <h3>📏 核心規則</h3>\n  <div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table>\n    <tr><th>主詞類型</th><th>動詞</th><th>例句</th></tr>\n    <tr><td>主詞 + 介系詞片語（of, in, with...）</td><td>依<b>前面</b>的主詞</td><td class=\"en\">The <b>list</b> of approved vendors <b>is</b> updated monthly.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>each / every / either / neither + 單數 N</td><td>單數</td><td class=\"en\">Every <b>applicant</b> <b>receives</b> a confirmation email.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>each of / one of / neither of + 複數 N</td><td>單數</td><td class=\"en\">One of the printers <b>is</b> out of order.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>A number of</b> + 複數 N（許多）</td><td>複數</td><td class=\"en\">A number of customers <b>have</b> complained.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>The number of</b> + 複數 N（……的數量）</td><td>單數</td><td class=\"en\">The number of visitors <b>has</b> doubled.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>either A or B／neither A nor B／not only A but also B</td><td>依<b>靠近的 B</b></td><td class=\"en\">Neither the manager nor the <b>interns</b> <b>were</b> informed.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>A as well as B／A along with B／A together with B／A in addition to B</td><td>依 <b>A</b></td><td class=\"en\">The <b>CEO</b>, along with her assistants, <b>is</b> arriving today.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>動名詞、不定詞、名詞子句當主詞</td><td>單數</td><td class=\"en\">Meeting deadlines <b>is</b> essential.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>關係子句中的動詞</td><td>依<b>先行詞</b></td><td class=\"en\">Employees who <b>work</b> remotely...</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>There is / There are + N</td><td>依後面的名詞</td><td class=\"en\">There <b>are</b> several options available.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>A and B（兩個主詞）</td><td>複數</td><td class=\"en\">The director and the manager <b>are</b> in a meeting.</td></tr>\n  </table></div>\n\n  <div class=\"callout trap\"><b>⚠️ 常見陷阱</b>\n    <ul>\n      <li>主詞和動詞中間夾著長修飾語時，先把修飾語劃掉：<span class=\"en\">The <s>results of the customer survey conducted last month</s> → The results <b>indicate</b>...</span></li>\n      <li>不可數名詞（information, equipment, furniture, merchandise, feedback）一律搭單數動詞。</li>\n      <li>空格的選項同時有限定動詞（indicates）和非限定動詞（indicating, to indicate）時，先檢查句子缺不缺主要動詞。</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3>🎯 實戰例題</h3>\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <h3>📝 延伸例句</h3>\n  <ul class=\"examples\">\n    <li><span class=\"en\">The information in these brochures <mark>is</mark> available in five languages.</span><span class=\"zh\">這些手冊中的資訊有五種語言版本。</span><span class=\"why\">不可數名詞 → 單數</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"en\">The number of online orders <mark>has</mark> risen sharply this quarter.</span><span class=\"zh\">本季線上訂單數量大幅上升。</span><span class=\"why\">The number of → 單數</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"en\">Not only the staff but also the manager <mark>was</mark> surprised by the announcement.</span><span class=\"zh\">不只員工，連經理也對這個宣布感到驚訝。</span><span class=\"why\">就近原則 → manager</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"en\">Whether the event will be postponed <mark>depends</mark> on the weather.</span><span class=\"zh\">活動是否延期取決於天氣。</span><span class=\"why\">名詞子句主詞 → 單數</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"en\">Customers who <mark>purchase</mark> a membership receive free shipping.</span><span class=\"zh\">購買會員的顧客可享免運費。</span><span class=\"why\">關係子句動詞依先行詞</span></li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>✅ 本章重點回顧</h3>\n  <ul class=\"checklist\">\n    <li>先刪掉主詞與動詞之間的修飾語，找出真正的主詞</li>\n    <li>A number of → 複數；The number of → 單數</li>\n    <li>either/neither/not only... → 就近原則；as well as/along with → 依前者</li>\n    <li>先定位空格所在子句；缺謂語時選限定動詞。已有謂語時，仍須檢查並列結構、關係子句或非限定修飾語。</li>\n  </ul>",
