    "id": "ch12",
    "title": "連接詞 vs 介系詞 vs 連接副詞",
    "subtitle": "Conjunctions vs Prepositions vs Conjunctive Adverbs — 從結構與上下文判斷連接方式",
    "group": "連接與介系",
    "summary": "同時檢查句法、標點與前後邏輯，區分原因、讓步、條件及結果。",
    "minutes": 9,
    "html": "<div class=\"callout tip\"><b>850+ 讀法練習</b><p>排除不合結構的選項後，仍須比較邏輯方向：because 引出原因，therefore 引出結果；前後兩句都要讀。</p></div>\n<div class=\"ch-head\"><span class=\"ch-no\">12</span><div><h2>連接詞 vs 介系詞 vs 連接副詞</h2><p class=\"ch-sub\">Conjunctions vs Prepositions vs Conjunctive Adverbs — 從結構與上下文判斷連接方式</p></div></div>\n  <div class=\"tags\"><span>文法類別：連接結構與句型</span><span class=\"f\">練習重點：連接詞 vs 介系詞 vs 連接副詞</span><span class=\"d\">難度：★★★★☆</span></div>\n\n  <h3>🧱 文法架構：三大家族「座位與文法功能」徹底拆解</h3>\n  <div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table>\n    <tr><th>類別</th><th>後面接什麼？</th><th>標點符號與位置特徵</th><th>文法功能</th></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>從屬連接詞</b><br>(Conjunction)</td><td><span class=\"kw\">完整子句 (S + V)</span></td><td>連接兩個完整子句：<br>• Conj + S + V, S + V.<br>• S + V + conj + S + V.</td><td>具備文法連接力，能把兩個子句黏在一起。</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>介系詞</b><br>(Preposition)</td><td><span class=\"kw\">名詞 / 代名詞 / V-ing</span></td><td>• Prep + N, S + V.<br>• S + V + prep + N.</td><td>常見介系詞多接名詞片語或 V-ing；也可能接 what 等名詞性子句。before、since、until 等接子句時，傳統教學歸為連接詞用法。</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>連接副詞</b><br>(Conjunctive Adverb)</td><td><span class=\"kw\">獨立句子 (S + V)</span></td><td>不能連接兩個子句！需獨立成句：<br>• S + V. <b>However,</b> S + V.<br>• S + V; <b>therefore,</b> S + V.</td><td>只是語氣轉折副詞，無文法連接力。前後通常有逗號或分號。</td></tr>\n  </table></div>\n\n  <h3>📊 語意同義三對照表（多益最愛出在同一題選項中讓考生混淆）</h3>\n  <div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table>\n    <tr><th>語意分類</th><th>從屬連接詞（+ S + V）</th><th>介系詞（+ N / V-ing）</th><th>連接副詞（句首或分號後，加逗號）</th></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>雖然／儘管</b><br>（讓步對比）</td><td><b>Although</b><br><b>Even though</b><br><b>Though</b><br><b>While</b> / <b>Whereas</b></td><td><b>Despite</b><br><b>In spite of</b><br><b>Notwithstanding</b></td><td><b>However</b><br><b>Nevertheless</b><br><b>Nonetheless</b><br><b>Even so</b></td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>因為／由於</b><br>（原因理由）</td><td><b>Because</b><br><b>Since</b><br><b>As</b><br><b>Now that</b>（既然）</td><td><b>Because of</b><br><b>Due to</b><br><b>Owing to</b><br><b>On account of</b></td><td><b>Therefore</b><br><b>Consequently</b><br><b>As a result</b></td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>此外／而且</b><br>（補充累加）</td><td>—（通常無直接對應）</td><td><b>In addition to</b><br><b>Besides</b><br><b>Apart from</b></td><td><b>Furthermore</b><br><b>Moreover</b><br><b>In addition</b><br><b>Besides</b></td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>條件／除非</b></td><td><b>Unless</b>（除非）<br><b>If</b> / <b>Provided that</b><br><b>As long as</b></td><td><b>Without</b><br><b>Barring</b><br><b>In case of</b></td><td><b>Otherwise</b>（否則）</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>在……期間</b></td><td><b>While</b>（當…之時）</td><td><b>During</b><br><b>Throughout</b></td><td><b>Meanwhile</b>（在此期間）</td></tr>\n  </table></div>\n\n  <div class=\"callout tip\"><b>💡 破題快速判斷三步口訣</b>\n    <ol>\n      <li><b>先找限定動詞並劃分子句</b>：V-ing、p.p.、to V 不等於另一個限定子句；再檢查是否需要並列或從屬連接成分。</li>\n      <li><b>檢查空格後面是「名詞」還是「子句」</b>：名詞 → 刪除連接詞，選介系詞；完整子句 (S + V) → 刪除介系詞，選連接詞。</li>\n      <li><b>檢查標點符號</b>：若是 <code>; _____ ,</code> 或 <code>. _____ ,</code> 形式，代表是連接副詞（如 However, Therefore）。</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"callout trap\"><b>⚠️ 常見致命陷阱</b>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>despite of</code> 是<b>不存在的錯誤用法</b>！只有 <b>despite + N</b> 或 <b>in spite of + N</b>。</li>\n      <li><code>during</code> vs <code>while</code>：during the meeting (介系詞 + 名詞)；while attending the meeting (連接詞 + 分詞構句或子句)。</li>\n      <li><code>because of</code> vs <code>because</code>：看到空格後面有長長一名詞片語，中間夾分詞修飾，切勿誤看成子句！<br>\n        例：<span class=\"en\">Because of the <u>regulations announced yesterday</u> (名詞 + p.p.修飾語，不是子句！)</span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3>🎯 實戰例題</h3>\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <h3>📝 延伸例句</h3>\n  <ul class=\"examples\">\n    <li><span class=\"en\"><mark>Now that</mark> the project is completed, we can focus on the next assignment.</span><span class=\"zh\">既然專案已經完成，我們就可以專注於下一個任務。</span><span class=\"why\">Now that（從屬連接詞：既然）+ 子句</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"en\">The proposal was rejected <mark>due to</mark> budget constraints.</span><span class=\"zh\">該提案因預算限制而遭到否決。</span><span class=\"why\">due to（介系詞）+ 名詞</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"en\">The software is easy to use; <mark>furthermore</mark>, it is completely free.</span><span class=\"zh\">該軟體易於使用；此外，它完全免費。</span><span class=\"why\">分號 + 連接副詞 furthermore + 逗號</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"en\"><mark>In addition to</mark> expanding abroad, the firm invested in R&amp;D.</span><span class=\"zh\">除了海外擴張外，該公司還投資了研發。</span><span class=\"why\">In addition to（介系詞）+ V-ing</span></li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>✅ 本章重點回顧</h3>\n  <ul class=\"checklist\">\n    <li>看到子句 (S + V) → 選 Although / Because / Unless / While 等連接詞</li>\n    <li>看到名詞片語 (N) → 選 Despite / Because of / Due to / During 等介系詞</li>\n    <li>看到「; _____ ,」或獨立句子句首加逗號 → 選 However / Therefore / Furthermore 等連接副詞</li>\n    <li>記住：絕無 despite of，只能說 despite 或 in spite of</li>\n  </ul>",
    "questionIds": [
      "q_66",
      "q_67",
      "q_68",
      "q_69",
      "q_70",
      "q_71"
    ]
