    "minutes": 5,
    "html": "<div class=\"callout tip\"><b>850+ 讀法練習</b><p>同義詞並非任何位置都可互換。記錄文章原句與選項的整體改寫，核對搭配、語氣及時間條件是否一致。</p></div>\n<div class=\"ch-head\"><span class=\"ch-no\">附</span><div><h2>附錄｜多益文法速查總表與常考混淆詞</h2><p class=\"ch-sub\">Quick Reference Guide &amp; High-Frequency Confusing Words</p></div></div>\n\n  <h3>⚡ 考前 10 分鐘文法自檢清單（Cheat Sheet）</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid2\">\n    <div class=\"box\">\n      <h5>① 動詞檢查三部曲</h5>\n      <p>1. <b>找主詞</b>：刪除介系詞片語修飾，單複數是否一致？</p>\n      <p>2. <b>看時態線索</b>：since / ago / by the time / currently？</p>\n      <p>3. <b>判斷語態</b>：空格後有沒有受詞？主詞能否自己做此動作？</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"box\">\n      <h5>② 詞性空格快速定位</h5>\n      <p>• 冠詞 / 所有格 + <b>[名詞]</b></p>\n      <p>• 冠詞 + <b>[形容詞]</b> + 名詞</p>\n      <p>• 助動詞 / be 動詞 + <b>[副詞]</b> + 本動詞 / p.p.</p>\n      <p>• make / keep / find + 受詞 + <b>[形容詞]</b></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"box\">\n      <h5>③ 連接詞與介系詞二選一</h5>\n      <p>• 空格後接 <b>S + V</b> → Although / Because / Unless</p>\n      <p>• 空格後接 <b>N / V-ing</b> → Despite / Because of / Without</p>\n      <p>• 標點符號 <code>; _____ ,</code> → However / Therefore / In addition</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"box\">\n      <h5>④ 不定詞 vs 動名詞關鍵字</h5>\n      <p>• 接 to V：plan, decide, aim, agree, expect, hope</p>\n      <p>• 接 V-ing：consider, suggest, recommend, avoid, postpone</p>\n      <p>• 介系詞 to + V-ing：look forward to, be committed to</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3>🔤 多益常考易混淆同源詞對照表（常見重點考點）</h3>\n  <div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table>\n    <tr><th>單字組合</th><th>詞性與中文意涵</th><th>例句搭配</th></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>economic</b> vs <b>economical</b></td><td>economic (adj.) 經濟上的<br><b>economical</b> (adj.) 節儉的、省錢的</td><td>economic growth (經濟成長)<br>an <b>economical</b> car (省油經濟的車)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>confidential</b> vs <b>confident</b></td><td><b>confidential</b> (adj.) 機密的<br>confident (adj.) 有自信的</td><td><b>confidential</b> documents (機密文件)<br>be confident about the outcome</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>respectful</b> vs <b>respective</b></td><td>respectful (adj.) 充滿敬意的<br><b>respective</b> (adj.) 各自的</td><td>be respectful to clients<br>return to their <b>respective</b> seats (各自的座位)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>sensitive</b> vs <b>sensible</b></td><td>sensitive (adj.) 敏感的、易受影響的<br><b>sensible</b> (adj.) 明智的、合理的</td><td>sensitive information (機密敏感資訊)<br>a <b>sensible</b> decision (明智的決定)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>reliable</b> vs <b>reliant</b></td><td><b>reliable</b> (adj.) 可信賴的（= dependable）<br>reliant (adj.) 依賴的（be reliant on）</td><td>a <b>reliable</b> supplier (可靠的供應商)<br>heavily reliant on imported oil</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>successful</b> vs <b>successive</b></td><td>successful (adj.) 成功的<br><b>successive</b> (adj.) 連續的（= consecutive）</td><td>a successful campaign<br>for three <b>successive</b> years (連續三年)</td></tr>\n  </table></div>\n\n  <h3>🔄 Part 7 也受用的 10 組商務同義詞置換清單（Paraphrasing）</h3>\n  <div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table>\n    <tr><th>題目／文章原文常出現</th><th>正確選項中常被置換為</th><th>中文意涵</th></tr>\n    <tr><td>postpone / put off</td><td><b>delay / reschedule</b></td><td>延期、重新安排</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>require / demand</td><td><b>mandate / necessitate</b></td><td>要求、使成為必需</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>implement / carry out</td><td><b>execute / apply</b></td><td>實施、執行</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>expand / enlarge</td><td><b>broaden / scale up</b></td><td>擴大、拓展</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>renovate / remodel</td><td><b>refurbish / upgrade</b></td><td>整修、改建</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>complimentary / no charge</td><td><b>free of charge</b></td><td>免費的</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>tentative / provisional</td><td><b>subject to change</b></td><td>暫定的、可能變動的</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>notify / inform</td><td><b>advise / alert</b></td><td>通知、告知</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>purchase / buy</td><td><b>acquire / procure</b></td><td>採購、購買</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>terminate / cancel</td><td><b>discontinue / end</b></td><td>終止、中止</td></tr>\n  </table></div>",
